  "quotes": [
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "If I'd been the whiting,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I'd have said to the porpoise, 'Keep back, please: we don't want _you_ with us!'"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "They were obliged to have him with them,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "no wise fish would go anywhere without a porpoise."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Wouldn't it really?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Of course not,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "why, if a fish came to _me_, and told me he was going a journey, I should say 'With what porpoise?'"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Don't you mean 'purpose'?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I mean what I say,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Come, let's hear some of _your_ adventures."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I could tell you my adventures—beginning from this morning,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "but it's no use going back to yesterday, because I was a different person then."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Explain all that,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "No, no! The adventures first,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "explanations take such a dreadful time."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "That's very curious."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "It's all about as curious as it can be,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "It all came different!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I should like to hear her try and repeat something now. Tell her to begin."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Stand up and repeat ''_Tis the voice of the sluggard_,'"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "'Tis the voice of the Lobster; I heard him declare, \"You have baked me too brown, I must sugar my hair.\" As a duck with its eyelids, so he with his nose Trims his belt and his buttons, and turns out his toes."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "That's different from what _I_ used to say when I was a child,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Well, I never heard it before,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "but it sounds uncommon nonsense."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I should like to have it explained,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "She can't explain it,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Go on with the next verse."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "But about his toes?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "How _could_ he turn them out with his nose, you know?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
