{
  "entities": [
    {
      "aliases": [],
      "chapter": null,
      "description": "A young lady who follows the Gryphon to the Mock Turtle, pities him, and asks him about his history and his schooling.",
      "kind": "Character",
      "mentions": [
        "Alice",
        "This here young lady",
        "poor Alice"
      ],
      "name": "Alice"
    },
    {
      "aliases": [],
      "chapter": null,
      "description": "A sad, lonely creature sitting on a little ledge of rock, sighing and sobbing with large eyes full of tears; he says he once was a real Turtle, and tells Alice and the Gryphon his history and about his school days in the sea.",
      "kind": "Character",
      "mentions": [
        "the Mock Turtle",
        "old fellow"
      ],
      "name": "the Mock Turtle"
    },
    {
      "aliases": [],
      "chapter": null,
      "description": "A creature who leads Alice to the Mock Turtle, tells her that his sorrow is all his fancy, urges the Mock Turtle to drive on with his story, and occasionally exclaims Hjckrrh!",
      "kind": "Character",
      "mentions": [
        "the Gryphon"
      ],
      "name": "the Gryphon"
    },
    {
      "aliases": [
        "an old Turtle"
      ],
      "chapter": null,
      "description": "An old Turtle who was master at the school in the sea; the Mock Turtle and the others used to call him Tortoise because he taught them.",
      "kind": "Character",
      "mentions": [
        "The master",
        "an old Turtle",
        "Tortoise"
      ],
      "name": "Tortoise"
    }
  ],
  "quotes": [
    {
      "addressee": "the Gryphon",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "What is his sorrow?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "Alice",
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "It’s all his fancy, that: he hasn’t got no sorrow, you know. Come on!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "the Mock Turtle",
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "This here young lady"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "the Mock Turtle",
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "she wants for to know your history, she do."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I’ll tell it her"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "sit down, both of you, and don’t speak a word till I’ve finished."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Once"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I was a real Turtle."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Hjckrrh!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "When we were little"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "we went to school in the sea. The master was an old Turtle—we used to call him Tortoise—"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Why did you call him Tortoise, if he wasn’t one?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "We called him Tortoise because he taught us"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "really you are very dull!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You ought to be ashamed of yourself for asking such a simple question"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "the Mock Turtle",
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Drive on, old fellow! Don’t be all day about it!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Yes, we went to school in the sea, though you mayn’t believe it—"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I never said I didn’t!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You did"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Hold your tongue!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "We had the best of educations—in fact, we went to school every day—"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "_I’ve_ been to a day-school, too"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "you needn’t be so proud as all that."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "With extras?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "we learned French and music."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "And washing?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Certainly not!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Ah! then yours wasn’t a really good school"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Now at _ours_ they had at the end of the bill, ‘French, music, _and washing_—extra.’"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You couldn’t have wanted it much"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "living at the bottom of the sea."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I couldn’t afford to learn it."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I only took the regular course."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "What was that?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Reeling and Writhing, of course, to begin with"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Mock Turtle",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "and then the different branches of Arithmetic—Ambition, Distraction, Uglification, and Derision."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I never heard of ‘Uglification,’"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "What! Never heard of uglifying!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You know what to beautify is, I suppose?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "it means—to—make—anything—prettier."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Well, then"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Gryphon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "if you don’t know what to uglify is, you _are_ a simpleton."
    }
  ],
