      "words": "Come, there’s no use in crying like that!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "herself",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I advise you to leave off this minute!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "But it’s no use now,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "to pretend to be two people! Why, there’s hardly enough of me left to make _one_ respectable person!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Well, I’ll eat it,"
