      "words": "I should like it very much,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "but I haven’t been invited yet."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Cat",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You’ll see me there,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Cat",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "By-the-bye, what became of the baby?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Cat",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I’d nearly forgotten to ask."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "It turned into a pig,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Cat",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I thought it would,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I’ve seen hatters before,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "the March Hare will be much the most interesting, and perhaps as this is May it won’t be raving mad—at least not so mad as it was in March."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Cat",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Did you say pig, or fig?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I said pig,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "and I wish you wouldn’t keep appearing and vanishing so suddenly: you make one quite giddy."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Cat",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "All right,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Well! I’ve often seen a cat without a grin,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "but a grin without a cat! It’s the most curious thing I ever saw in my life!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Suppose it should be raving mad after all! I almost wish I’d gone to see the Hatter instead!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Very uncomfortable for the Dormouse,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "only, as it’s asleep, I suppose it doesn’t mind."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the March Hare",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "No room! No room!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Hatter",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "No room! No room!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "There’s _plenty_ of room!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the March Hare",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Have some wine,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I don’t see any wine,"
    }
  ],
