  "quotes": [
    {
      "addressee": "herself",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "There’s certainly too much pepper in that soup!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Please would you tell me,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "why your cat grins like that?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "It’s a Cheshire cat,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "the baby",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "and that’s why. Pig!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I didn’t know that Cheshire cats always grinned; in fact, I didn’t know that cats _could_ grin."
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "They all can,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "and most of ’em do."
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I don’t know of any that do,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You don’t know much,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "and that’s a fact."
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Oh, _please_ mind what you’re doing!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Oh, there goes his _precious_ nose!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "If everybody minded their own business,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "the world would go round a deal faster than it does."
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Which would _not_ be an advantage,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Just think of what work it would make with the day and night! You see the earth takes twenty-four hours to turn round on its axis—"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Talking of axes,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "chop off her head!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Twenty-four hours, I _think_; or is it twelve? I—"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Oh, don’t bother _me_,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I never could abide figures!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Speak roughly to your little boy,\n    And beat him when he sneezes:\nHe only does it to annoy,\n    Because he knows it teases."
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the cook",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Wow! wow! wow!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the baby",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Wow! wow! wow!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I speak severely to my boy,\n    I beat him when he sneezes;\nFor he can thoroughly enjoy\n    The pepper when he pleases!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "Alice",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Here! you may nurse it a bit, if you like!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "",
      "speaker": "the Duchess",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I must go and get ready to play croquet with the Queen,"
    }
