      "words": "Are you content now?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "sir",
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Well, I should like to be a _little_ larger, sir, if you wouldn’t mind,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "three inches is such a wretched height to be."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "It is a very good height indeed!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "But I’m not used to it!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You’ll get used to it in time,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "One side will make you grow taller, and the other side will make you grow shorter."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Of the mushroom,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "And now which is which?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Come, my head’s free at last!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "What _can_ all that green stuff be?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "And where _have_ my shoulders got to? And oh, my poor hands, how is it I can’t see you?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Pigeon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Serpent!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I’m _not_ a serpent!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Let me alone!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Pigeon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Serpent, I say again!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Pigeon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I’ve tried every way, and nothing seems to suit them!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I haven’t the least idea what you’re talking about,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Pigeon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I’ve tried the roots of trees, and I’ve tried banks, and I’ve tried hedges,"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Pigeon",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "but those serpents! There’s no pleasing them!"
    }
  ],
  "relationships": []
}

{
  "entities": [
    {
      "aliases": [],
