      "kind": "Character",
      "mentions": [
        "the Caterpillar",
        "the Caterpillar's"
      ],
      "name": "the Caterpillar"
    },
    {
      "aliases": [
        "the sage",
        "his father"
      ],
      "chapter": null,
      "description": "An old man in the poem Alice recites, who stood on his head, turned somersaults, and took to the law in his youth.",
      "kind": "Character",
      "mentions": [
        "Father William",
        "the sage",
        "his father"
      ],
      "name": "Father William"
    },
    {
      "aliases": [
        "the youth",
        "his son"
      ],
      "chapter": null,
      "description": "Father William's son, who questions his father in the poem Alice recites.",
      "kind": "Character",
      "mentions": [
        "the young man",
        "the youth",
        "his son"
      ],
      "name": "the young man"
    }
  ],
  "quotes": [
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Well, perhaps your feelings may be different"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "all I know is, it would feel very queer to me"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "Alice",
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I think, you ought to tell me who you are, first"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "Alice",
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Come back!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I've something important to say!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Keep your temper"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Is that all?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "No"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "So you think you're changed, do you?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I'm afraid I am, sir"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I can't remember things as I used—and I don't keep the same size for ten minutes together!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Can't remember what things?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Well, I've tried to say \"How doth the little busy bee,\" but it all came different!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Repeat, 'You are old, Father William'"
    },
    {
      "addressee": "Father William",
      "speaker": "the young man",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You are old, Father William"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the young man",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "And your hair has become very white; And yet you incessantly stand on your head— Do you think, at your age, it is right?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Father William",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "In my youth"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Father William",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I feared it might injure the brain; But, now that I'm perfectly sure I have none, Why, I do it again and again."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the young man",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You are old"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the young man",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "as I mentioned before, And have grown most uncommonly fat; Yet you turned a back-somersault in at the door— Pray, what is the reason of that?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Father William",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "In my youth"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Father William",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I kept all my limbs very supple By the use of this ointment—one shilling the box— Allow me to sell you a couple?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the young man",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You are old"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the young man",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "and your jaws are too weak For anything tougher than suet; Yet you finished the goose, with the bones and the beak— Pray, how did you manage to do it?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Father William",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "In my youth"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Father William",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I took to the law, And argued each case with my wife; And the muscular strength, which it gave to my jaw, Has lasted the rest of my life."
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the young man",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "You are old"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the young man",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "one would hardly suppose That your eye was as steady as ever; Yet you balanced an eel on the end of your nose— What made you so awfully clever?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Father William",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I have answered three questions, and that is enough"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Father William",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "don't give yourself airs! Do you think I can listen all day to such stuff? Be off, or I'll kick you down stairs!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "That is not said right"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Not quite right, I'm afraid"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "some of the words have got altered"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "It is wrong from beginning to end"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "What size do you want to be?"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Oh, I'm not particular as to size"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "only one doesn't like changing so often, you know"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I don't know"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "the Caterpillar",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "Are you content now?"
    }
  ],
