      "words": "and now for the garden!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "and in that case I can go back by railway"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I wish I hadn't cried so much!"
    },
    {
      "addressee": null,
      "speaker": "Alice",
      "type": "SAYS",
      "words": "I shall be punished for it now, I suppose, by being drowned in my own tears! That _will_ be a queer thing, to be sure! However, everything is queer to-day."
    },
